          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. MP-BGP is an enhanced version of BGP that can carry a service label, a tranpot label, and customer route prefixes."
            }
          ]
        },
        "E": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "E. None of the above statements describe the use of an MP-BGP in a VPRN."
            }
          ]
        },
        "F": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "F. All of the above statements describe the use of an MP-BGP in a VPRN."
            }
